---
description: Core engineering rules for Flowlytics
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow AGENTS.md and docs/PRODUCT_SPEC.md. Prefer modular monolith vertical slices. Keep PROJECT_STATE.md current. When changing UX or product behaviour, update docs/PRODUCT_SPEC.md, docs/design/*, ASSUMPTIONS.md if needed, and relevant .cursor/rules in the same change. No secrets in git. No production deploy without approval.
